---
args: { decisions: DecisionAtom[], prepared: PreparedEvidence, input: CaseInput }
returns: DraftDebtSymptom
---
Construct a DebtSymptom draft with its actual domain fields. Only supported values enter `values`; preserve conflicts, missing fields and evidence bindings. Process developer reports, incidents, and issue histories to identify recurring friction. Separate specific observed costs from broad complaints, deduplicate repeated descriptions of one event, and preserve minority workflows that may face severe but infrequent problems.
